  "author_positive_body": "Hi Riley! My favourite activity is drawing small comics. I started last autumn when my cousin gave me a notebook. At first, I copied simple faces from her drawings. Now I make short stories about everyday surprises. Drawing helps me notice little things around me, and sharing a funny page can make my friends smile. You don't need expensive tools, so you could try it with a pencil and paper.",
